{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/Prisonela_logo.png?t=1744254457\" /><br>Get ready for platforming incarceration insanity in this new Megadrive game, Prisonela MD. These levels may be short, but fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/gif2.gif?t=1744254457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your special parkour abilities to overcome all the obstacles, and avoid all the traps. Don\u2019t expect to atone for your mistakes in this prison madhouse though. Each time you die, you\u2019ll be warped to a completely different level where you\u2019ll have to adapt and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/gif1.gif?t=1744254457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to escape this platforming prison hell? Find out in Prisonela MD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542390/extras/gif3.gif?t=1744254457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also includes the ROM file you can burn and play on your original hardware if you have it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CRT shader option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random level order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platformer gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute pixel art style</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542390?t=1744254457","background_raw":"https://sha